WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.513 --> 00:00:15.239
The Tang Monk was crying quietly.

2
00:00:20.762 --> 00:00:21.863
was right to warn us.

3
00:00:22.763 --> 00:00:26.365
Those nice villagers turned out to be demons!"

4
00:00:27.225 --> 00:00:29.046
Strong ropes tied him to a column.

5
00:00:29.627 --> 00:00:31.488
Bajie and Wujing were tied up too.

6
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:39.304
"We should have listened to Wukong," Wujing said, struggling to break free.

7
00:00:40.645 --> 00:00:43.766
Bajie twisted in his ropes and shouted, "Villains!

8
00:00:44.347 --> 00:00:45.287
Evil demons!

9
00:00:45.647 --> 00:00:47.208
How dare you kidnap us!

10
00:00:47.949 --> 00:00:48.789
You'll regret it!

11
00:00:49.189 --> 00:00:51.451
Our good friend, Sun Wukong, will find us!

12
00:00:52.271 --> 00:00:55.933
He's really powerful—even the Jade Emperor is afraid of him!"

13
00:00:56.974 --> 00:00:58.314
Just then his stomach growled.

14
00:00:59.795 --> 00:01:00.916
The Tang Monk frowned.

15
00:01:01.696 --> 00:01:04.517
"Bajie, how can you think about food right now?"

16
00:01:05.937 --> 00:01:07.118
Wujing shook his head.

17
00:01:07.138 --> 00:01:09.698
"That's terrible, Bajie."

18
00:01:09.718 --> 00:01:15.080
"I can't help it," Bajie said, continuing to struggle with his ropes.

19
00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.720
"I haven't eaten anything today."

20
00:01:19.041 --> 00:01:22.362
The Tang Monk watched Bajie and Wujing squirm wildly.

21
00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:24.682
"Do you think you can break free?"

22
00:01:25.963 --> 00:01:26.783
Bajie grunted.

23
00:01:26.803 --> 00:01:30.724
"My ropes are getting loose."

24
00:01:36.242 --> 00:01:38.083
Bajie's yells echoed through the cave.

25
00:01:40.064 --> 00:01:43.426
Several small demons in the kitchen heard him and ran into the throne room.

26
00:01:45.787 --> 00:01:47.608
The Demon of Black Rain glared at them.

27
00:01:47.628 --> 00:01:49.609
"What are you doing?

28
00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:51.230
I'm starving!

29
00:01:52.171 --> 00:01:55.272
Why aren't you getting ready to cook the Tang Monk?"

30
00:01:56.793 --> 00:01:58.894
One small demon held up a bowl of spices.

31
00:01:58.914 --> 00:02:01.376
"We are getting ready to cook him, Master!

32
00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:05.421
But the prisoners know Sun Wukong, the Monkey King!"

33
00:02:06.461 --> 00:02:07.902
The Demon of Black Rain yawned.

34
00:02:07.922 --> 00:02:13.143
"Yes, I heard that noisy pig shouting."

35
00:02:14.903 --> 00:02:15.704
"What will we do?"

36
00:02:16.144 --> 00:02:17.124
the small demon asked.

37
00:02:17.144 --> 00:02:19.425
"Sun Wukong is powerful.

38
00:02:19.825 --> 00:02:22.886
He once defeated Heaven's entire army!"

39
00:02:22.906 --> 00:02:25.966
"Even the Jade Emperor is afraid of him!

40
00:02:26.727 --> 00:02:31.508
If we eat the Tang Monk, Sun Wukong will attack us," another demon said.

41
00:02:32.764 --> 00:02:33.904
A third demon shuddered.

42
00:02:33.924 --> 00:02:38.046
"Maybe we shouldn't eat the Tang Monk!"

43
00:02:39.286 --> 00:02:41.106
The Demon of Black Rain held up a hand.

44
00:02:41.126 --> 00:02:44.647
"We will eat the Tang Monk and live forever.

45
00:02:45.768 --> 00:02:48.168
I'm not afraid of Sun Wukong.

46
00:02:49.889 --> 00:02:52.230
Swift Wing knows someone who can help."

47
00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:54.570
A bird demon gasped.

48
00:02:55.711 --> 00:02:57.491
"I do?"

49
00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:00.032
The Demon of Black Rain nodded.

50
00:03:00.828 --> 00:03:06.189
"You told me you saw a goddess who was more powerful than Sun Wukong."

51
00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:10.711
A small demon gasped, and he dropped the bowl of spices.

52
00:03:10.731 --> 00:03:15.092
"More powerful than Sun Wukong?"

53
00:03:16.332 --> 00:03:18.713
The small demons looked eagerly at Swift Wing.

54
00:03:18.733 --> 00:03:21.854
"Where is this goddess, Swift Wing?"

55
00:03:22.354 --> 00:03:23.614
the Demon of Black Rain asked.

56
00:03:23.634 --> 00:03:25.755
"I'd like to meet her."

57
00:03:25.775 --> 00:03:30.156
"Um, you can't," Swift Wing said.

58
00:03:31.052 --> 00:03:32.614
"She's in another world."

59
00:03:34.315 --> 00:03:35.736
The Demon of Black Rain stood up.

60
00:03:35.756 --> 00:03:39.099
"You must know how to get there.

61
00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:40.480
Tell me how!"

62
00:03:42.001 --> 00:03:44.603
Shaking, Swift Wing quickly recited a spell.

63
00:03:47.086 --> 00:03:48.727
Light sparkled and then—zoomp!

64
00:03:49.548 --> 00:03:50.348
An image appeared.

65
00:03:51.649 --> 00:03:54.692
The image showed a strange kingdom with tall buildings.

66
00:03:54.712 --> 00:03:59.516
"That's where the goddess is," Swift Wing muttered.

67
00:04:01.664 --> 00:04:04.385
"Amazing," the Demon of Black Rain whispered.

68
00:04:04.405 --> 00:04:07.186
"The image looks so real."

69
00:04:09.087 --> 00:04:14.029
"It is real," Swift Wing said with a sigh.

70
00:04:14.049 --> 00:04:17.751
"The spell opens a portal to that world.

71
00:04:18.711 --> 00:04:21.613
You can simply step through, and you'll be there."

72
00:04:23.153 --> 00:04:26.675
Crash! A door exploded, and Bajie ran into the throne room.

73
00:04:26.695 --> 00:04:33.776
"I won't let you harm my—Whoa!"

74
00:04:33.956 --> 00:04:37.861
Bajie tripped on the bowl and stumbled through the portal, which closed behind him.
